{"full": [{"t": "© 2.5 hours / week", "y": 394, "x": 693, "h": 35}, {"x": 334, "t": "Add To Training Plan", "y": 516, "h": 39}, {"h": 36, "t": "Overview", "y": 703, "x": 52}, {"y": 791, "h": 42, "t": "This 6-week program is designed for bouldering", "x": 52}, {"t": "specialists new to structured power endurance", "y": 835, "h": 39, "x": 52}, {"y": 886, "t": "training that would like to improve their fitness on", "h": 38, "x": 48}, {"h": 38, "x": 45, "y": 934, "t": "longer boulder problems. The template is designed to"}, {"h": 38, "x": 52, "t": "be split across two training days per week. The first", "y": 980}, {"t": "training day should consist of the Warm-up, followed", "y": 1029, "h": 41, "x": 48}, {"t": "by project bouldering using the Style Triad workout,", "x": 52, "y": 1077, "h": 38}, {"h": 35, "t": "and then either Drop Intervals (Weeks 1-3) or 6 in 6", "x": 48, "y": 1126}, {"h": 34, "t": "(Weeks 3-6) to complete the session. The second", "y": 1172, "x": 52}, {"x": 48, "y": 1217, "h": 42, "t": "training day will consist of the Warm-up, followed by"}, {"h": 35, "t": "Boulder Triples (except on Week 3). Additional", "y": 1265, "x": 52}, {"h": 34, "t": "sessions can be added to this plan in order to maintain", "x": 52, "y": 1314}, {"h": 38, "y": 1359, "x": 52, "t": "strength & power."}, {"t": "Schedule", "y": 1545, "h": 35, "x": 52}, {"x": 52, "y": 1642, "t": "Week 1", "h": 36}, {"t": "Base", "h": 34, "x": 229, "y": 1643}, {"x": 93, "t": "Style Triad", "y": 1745, "h": 41}, {"y": 1796, "x": 94, "h": 34, "t": "Project bouldering"}, {"x": 94, "t": "Warm Up Protocol - Bouldering", "h": 42, "y": 1897}, {"h": 46, "y": 1942, "x": 93, "t": "An easy to follow warm up routine before a"}, {"y": 1987, "t": "bouldering session", "h": 38, "x": 94}, {"x": 83, "y": 2092, "t": "Boulder Triples", "h": 38}, {"x": 87, "t": "Repeated boulders - triple laps", "y": 2141, "h": 35}, {"y": 2246, "h": 34, "t": "Drop Intervals", "x": 83}, {"t": "Easy/moderate bouldering - dropping in inten